      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I get an accurate moving cost estimate for a house shift within Ajmer?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by gathering the total volume of items, the number of rooms, and any special items like pianos or antiques. Use our online instant quote tool, entering exact pickup and drop‑off addresses, preferred moving date, and required packing services. The system calculates distance‑based rates, vehicle size, and optional insurance, delivering a transparent estimate within minutes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance offered by Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers truly 100% coverage?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy that insures the full declared value of your goods. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, you can file a claim online, provide photographic evidence and inventory, and receive reimbursement up to the insured amount without hidden deductibles.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does IBA approval mean for customers hiring packers and movers in Ajmer?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The Indian Banks Association (IBA) approval certifies that the mover adheres to a strict code of conduct, financial transparency, and grievance redress mechanisms. It assures Ajmer customers that the company can issue reimbursable invoices for corporate or government relocation claims, and that all financial transactions are audited and trustworthy.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my belongings in real time during the Ajmer‑to‑hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each of our 120+ container trucks is equipped with GPS telemetry that feeds live location data to a secure portal. Customers receive a unique tracking ID and can monitor progress, estimated arrival times, and checkpoint clearances from the moment the truck leaves Ajmer until it reaches the destination hub.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the key factors that influence the final price of a move from Ajmer to a major city?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The final cost is shaped by four main variables: (1) distance – the 850 km stretch determines base mileage charges; (2) vehicle type – 18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft containers are selected based on load volume; (3) packing services – opting for the 7‑layer protective system adds material fees; and (4) insurance level – full coverage versus basic liability changes the premium.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging system protect fragile items during long‑distance moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap that cushions impact, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors that absorb shocks. Multi‑ply corrugated sheets create a rigid barrier, while stretch film seals against moisture. For especially delicate pieces, custom wooden crates are added as the final layer, ensuring stability throughout the Ajmer‑to‑hub journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special regulations or checkpost procedures I should know about on the Ajmer transit route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. The route traverses several state‑run checkposts where e‑Way bills must be presented, and vehicle dimensions are verified against highway regulations. Our logistics team handles all paperwork, ensures compliance with the National Highway Authority’s load limits, and coordinates with local authorities to minimize delays, keeping your relocation smooth and on schedule.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
